### 1. Test Root Endpoint (Check server running and verify X-Request-ID in response)
GET http://localhost:8080/

### 2. Test Custom Request ID Header
GET http://localhost:8080/
X-Request-ID: test-custom-client-id-12345

### 3. Test Health Check (Filtered out of noisy logs)
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 4. Register a New User
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 5. Login (Returns JWT token)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Get Categories (Protected by JWT - Replace {{token}} with the token from login)
GET http://localhost:8080/categories
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Get Products for Category
GET http://localhost:8080/categories/1/products
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 8. Test 404 Not Found Handling
GET http://localhost:8080/api/unknown-endpoint
